Upstream origin
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Plombir Git was developed under the name ForgeKeep until October 2026, and
began as a fork of IronForge:

    https://github.com/lengyuqu/ironforge

At the time of forking, the upstream IronForge README identified the project
as MIT licensed in two places: an "MIT" license badge and a plain-text
"License: MIT" statement in the body of the README. However, the upstream
repository did not ship a LICENSE, NOTICE, or COPYING file containing the full
MIT License text and an explicit copyright notice, and GitHub reported no
detected license for it.

